        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"9f3a3f28-beea-4466-8990-a06fa14fa489\",\"review_text\":\"Really good and professional, but personalized to you\"},{\"review_id\":\"55773dad-29cd-40ba-804d-923a6576d83e\",\"review_text\":\"I can jam out... nonstop!! Love the app!\"},{\"review_id\":\"6c53aaa3-ff14-4f9f-b95f-7aa552a8ef28\",\"review_text\":\"I am using Spotify from more than 2 years .and it used to be most convenient app for listening music.. But after this latest update it is turning out to be worst...as you cannot even play songs from mid ..from wherever u want to hear and u can't even skip songs more than 6 tym ..u cant shuffle songs or play one song continuously...every feature is just now for premium users only...this update is just worst...\"},{\"review_id\":\"760c2d4c-67de-4c97-8114-a6870db3d5e5\",\"review_text\":\"This is my favorite streaming service.\"},{\"review_id\":\"f433778e-2a13-4673-a1cf-ab8a467b54df\",\"review_text\":\"I definitely recommend this app\"},{\"review_id\":\"18e3876e-08a1-44f6-b993-5a891efd935e\",\"review_text\":\"Many bug lag\"},{\"review_id\":\"85e978f0-13e5-4264-8d3d-251ac5c36461\",\"review_text\":\"Good app but the ads are also like crazy there is a video when you listening music\"},{\"review_id\":\"840dfd09-fc65-4aae-8a67-874cc8b5ceb1\",\"review_text\":\"Overall a good app for music! I give it 4 stars only because it glitches more than usual since I've actually downloaded the app, but I could give it a 5 star rating!\"},{\"review_id\":\"1c3d4674-87b3-4cf0-8028-c4a34260c0ce\",\"review_text\":\"Describe your experience\"},{\"review_id\":\"a101f272-bd3d-49cb-9dda-ad61c623c8d8\",\"review_text\":\"I love hearing music and I had to here my favorite song over and over again\"}]}"
